# Capability Maturity Levels

The platform should be designed to support four maturity levels.

## Level 1

Discovery

Purpose:

Find existing workflows, runbooks, and supported execution paths.

No execution occurs.

---

## Level 2

Conversational Execution Preparation

Purpose:

Select an existing workflow, extract known inputs, collect missing inputs, and prepare an approval-ready plan.

Execution occurs only after approval.

---

## Level 3

Composed Change Planning

Purpose:

Combine multiple workflows and manual procedures into a larger implementation plan represented as a dependency-aware graph.

---

## Level 4

Capability Gap Detection And Proposal Generation

Purpose:

Detect unsupported change intents, generate procedures and workflow proposals, and record demand for future automation investment.

