# Execution Plans

Execution plans should be represented as DAGs.

Example:

backup_device

↓

remove_monitoring

↓

remove_dns

↓

remove_nautobot_record

Future capabilities:

* parallel execution
* rollback plans
* dependency resolution
* conditional execution

AI-triggered execution must reuse the existing execution path of the target provider.

Workflow Launcher should call the same execution entry point used by its normal launch flow.

Execution records should capture whether a run originated from a form UI, API, or AI conversation.

---

# Approval Framework

All execution plans must persist approval state and approval history.

States:

* draft
* pending
* approved
* rejected
* executing
* completed
* failed

Only approved plans may execute.

Initial implementation may use self-approval only.

Future implementations may introduce role-based approvals by risk level.

