# Workflow Launcher Integration

Workflow Launcher is an execution provider and capability source.

Workflow Launcher remains responsible for:

* workflow execution
* AWX integration
* automation orchestration
* execution logging
* approvals within its own domain
* workflow management

Change Copilot consumes Workflow Launcher APIs.

Change Copilot must not directly execute AWX jobs.

Required integration capabilities:

* workflow search
* workflow metadata
* workflow inputs and schema
* workflow execution
* workflow status
* workflow history

